v3.0.0 - back to working on the game

Bug Fixes:
+ Days logged in now increments even if you never leave the game.
+ Clover Upgrader is now anchored and usable.
+ Luck Machine (on base) no longer has a collision.

Changes:
+ People with enough playtime to justify days logged in have been adjusted.
+ New Build Mode, which includes Box Select, Axis Binding, and tons of new filters

Balance Changes:
+ Decreased Life 8 Rebirth price: 1Ud -> 50N 
+ Added 2 new tiles of space for Life 8.
